{
  "sn55.23:0.1": "Linked Discourses 55.23 ",
  "sn55.23:0.2": "3. About Sarakāni ",
  "sn55.23:0.3": "With Godhā the Sakyan ",
  "sn55.23:1.1": "At Kapilavatthu. ",
  "sn55.23:1.2": "Then Mahānāma the Sakyan went up to Godhā the Sakyan, and said to her, ",
  "sn55.23:1.3": "“Godhā, how many things must an individual have for you to recognize them as a stream-enterer, not liable to be reborn in the underworld, assured, destined for awakening?” ",
  "sn55.23:2.1": "“Mahānāma, an individual must have three things for me to recognize them as a stream-enterer. ",
  "sn55.23:2.2": "What three? ",
  "sn55.23:2.3": "It’s when a noble disciple has experiential confidence in the Buddha … ",
  "sn55.23:2.4": "",
  "sn55.23:2.5": "the teaching … ",
  "sn55.23:2.6": "and the Saṅgha … ",
  "sn55.23:2.7": "",
  "sn55.23:2.8": "When an individual has these three things I recognize them as a stream-enterer. ",
  "sn55.23:3.1": "But Mahānāma, how many things must an individual have for <em>you</em> to recognize them as a stream-enterer?” ",
  "sn55.23:3.2": "“Godhā, an individual must have four things for me to recognize them as a stream-enterer. ",
  "sn55.23:3.3": "What four? ",
  "sn55.23:3.4": "It’s when a noble disciple has experiential confidence in the Buddha … ",
  "sn55.23:3.5": "",
  "sn55.23:3.6": "the teaching … ",
  "sn55.23:3.7": "the Saṅgha … ",
  "sn55.23:3.8": "And they have the ethical conduct loved by the noble ones … leading to immersion. ",
  "sn55.23:3.9": "When 